Package: mamars
Type: Package
Title: Memory-Efficient MAMA Core Implemented in Rust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MAMA", "Developers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.org")
Description: A small, dependency-free Rust implementation of the core
    multi-ancestry meta-analysis estimator. Computation is performed one SNP at
    a time so that intermediate P by P matrices are never materialised for all
    variants at once.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust)

